=2 Walkthrough
* Once you accept the assignment, the {n:Task Delegator} will provide you with a {k:Hen. FS building mat. container} to deliver to a Station Administrator in {z:Foret de Hennetiel}.
** As of the {p:Feb. 18 2014 Version Update|http://forum.square-enix.com/ffxi/threads/40059-Feb-18-2014-%28JST%29-Version-Update?p=493165&viewfull=1#post493165}, Waypoints can now be used to complete this task without risk of break. Simply warp to a Station Administrator.

+ Zone out to {z:Ceizak Battlegrounds} from Western Adoulin at (C-9).
+ Run southwest and zone to {z:Sih Gates} around the border of (G-11)/(H-11) in {z:Ceizak Battlegrounds}.
+ Run south and zone to {z:Foret de Hennetiel} at (H-11).
+ From the entrance of {z:Foret de Hennetiel}, run a little ways into the first open area and take the south path to (J-7).
+ Speak to the {p:Bivouac#2 Administrator|Bivouac} at (J-10) to complete the assignment.

* Return to the {n:Task Delegator} to receive your reward.

=2 Notes
* {p:http://forum.square-enix.com/ffxi/threads/40059-Feb-18-2014-%28JST%29-Version-Update?p=493165&viewfull=1#post493165}
* Movement speed increasing effects recommended.
* Once the {z:Foret de Hennetiel} Frontier Station has been constructed, this assignment can no longer be undertaken.

